                      "longDescription": "This modern minimal living room is designed around restful negative space and a single, confident accent. The L-shape sofa anchors the seating zone in genuine Italian top-grain leather, balanced by a walnut coffee table with brushed brass inlays. A wall-mounted modular TV unit with integrated cove lighting keeps storage hidden and sight lines clean. Acoustic linen drapes frame floor-to-ceiling glazing, while engineered oak flooring with a matte clear coat ties the palette together. The result is a calm, low-glare space ideal for evening conversations and weekend films, scaled for a 3 BHK Worli residence.",
